 "issue_body": "TIR returns real R=1 but drops complex retardance\n(`polarization.py:208-209` \u2014 breaks Fresnel-rhomb phase); R/L handedness and\nS\u2083 sign undocumented (`:57,62,95-98`); ghost ignores coatings and counts\nvignetted ghosts (`ghost.py:135-149`); Al-only housing CTE\n(`environmental.py:127`); 90th-percentile off-by-one (`tolerancing.py:284`);\nsingle-lens BFL returns `inf` vs system `None`; `f/#=|f|/D` drops diverging sign.",
