 "pr": 275,
 "pr_title": "fix(physics): TIR phase, ghost logic, housing CTE, percentile, BFL No\u2026",
 "pr_body": "\u2026ne, docs\r\n\r\nBundle of review leftovers: fresnel_coefficients returns complex unit-magnitude TIR coefficients (Fresnel-rhomb s/p retardance verified against the analytic formula) instead of real 1.0; ghost _interact compares RefractionResult explicitly (plain-Enum members are all truthy, so misses never aborted paths) and documents the bulk-Fresnel-only, flare-conservative counting policy; apply_environment takes a housing_cte parameter (was hardcoded aluminum); 90th percentile uses linear interpolation (was off-by-one, 3.7-safe manual implementation); Lens BFL/FFL return None like the system API (GUI updated); document R/L-S3-handedness, Jones-only-DOP, and photographic f/# conventions.",
